  "description": "MultiTypeParameterGenerator is a C# source generator that automatically creates method variants with multiple types for a single parameter. This tool reduces boilerplate code by generating overloads for methods that need to work with different types. It's ideal for developers who want to provide a type-safe API with broad type support without manually writing numerous similar method implementations.",
